        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rounded box = node label, &lt;u&gt;underlined&lt;/u&gt; = key property (uniqueness constraint).&lt;br&gt;Arrow = relationship, drawn in the stored direction. Dashed box = extra label &lt;i&gt;:Unlisted&lt;/i&gt; on a Model.&lt;br&gt;Dotted = computed by GDS, not declared in a card.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Schema: 8 uniqueness constraints, 10 range indexes, 1 fulltext index (model_search)&lt;/b&gt; (app/database/schema.py)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#999999;rounded=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
